---
import ServicePage from '../layouts/ServicePage.astro';
import { pineHarbour } from '../data/qa';
import photo from '../assets/photos/cabin.jpg';
---

<ServicePage
  title="How Shore Leave Works | Boat reset and restock, Auckland"
  description="How a Shore Leave boat reset works: book, we reset, you come back to a ready boat. Key handover, what we need from you and exactly what's covered."
  crumb="How it works"
  h1="Book. We reset. You come back to a ready boat."
  lede="Three steps, and only the first one needs you."
  photo={photo}
  photoAlt="Inside a sailboat cabin, with daylight coming down the companionway"
  faqs={[pineHarbour[1]]}
  links={[
    { href: '/book', label: 'Book a reset' },
    { href: '/pricing', label: 'How quotes work' },
    { href: '/pine-harbour-boat-cleaning', label: 'Pine Harbour berths' },
    { href: '/terms', label: 'Terms' },
  ]}
>
  <section class="wrap band">
    <h2>The three steps</h2>
    <ol class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-10 md:gap-8 list-none">
      <li class="border-t border-navy pt-5">
        <span class="font-display text-6xl">1</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4">Book</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">Fill in the form or call. Tell us the boat, the location, and what you'd like done. We'll reply with a quote and agree on access.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t border-navy pt-5">
        <span class="font-display text-6xl">2</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4">We reset</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">We get aboard at the agreed time, work through the list and take photos before and after. If we spot anything you should know about, we'll tell you.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="border-t border-navy pt-5">
        <span class="font-display text-6xl">3</span>
        <h3 class="mt-4">You come back to a ready boat</h3>
        <p class="mt-2">We lock up and send you a short note. The next time you're down, the deck's clean, the beds are made and the fridge is sorted.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-sand-2">
    <div class="wrap band grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-12">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2>What we need from you</h2>
      </div>
      <ul class="crosses lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 lg:mt-2 text-lg">
        <li>Your boat's location: pier and berth, or home address</li>
        <li>A way aboard, agreed before the first job</li>
        <li>Fresh water at the berth, or an outside tap at home</li>
        <li>Your restock list, if you want one</li>
        <li>Where your spare linen is kept</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap band lg:grid lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-12">
    <h2 class="lg:col-span-5">What's not included</h2>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 mt-4 lg:mt-2 grid gap-4">
      <p>We work on deck and inside the boat. That's the whole scope. Engines, electrics and repairs aren't us, and we won't pretend otherwise.</p>
      <p>If we notice something that needs a specialist, we'll tell you and you can decide what to do about it.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServicePage>
